        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il fait son nid au fond des marais.\nIl ne se pose pas de question et avale\ntoutes les créatures qui passent près de lui.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon baut sein Nest am Grund von\nSümpfen. Es ist ein Vielfraß und verspeist\nLebewesen aller Art.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Construye su nido en el fondo de los pantanos.\nEs tan voraz que no le hace ascos a ningún tipo\nde comida, siempre que se trate de seres vivos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nidifica nel letto delle paludi. Incredibilmente\nvorace, mangia qualunque essere vivente senza\ndistinzione di sorta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It makes its nest at the bottom of swamps. It will\neat anything—if it is alive, Whiscash will eat it.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "沼の　底に　すみかを　つくる。\n生き物なら　好き嫌いなく\nなんでも　食べてしまう　大食らい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会在沼泽底部筑巢。\n只要是活物就来者不拒，\n是什么都吃的大胃王。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Construye su nido en el fondo de los pantanos.\nEs tan voraz que no le hace ascos a ningún tipo\nde comida, siempre que se trate de seres vivos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "おおきな　ぬまを　なわばりにする。\nてきが　ちかづくと　おおあばれして\nおおきな　じしんを　おこすのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "큰 늪을 영역으로 한다.\n적이 가까이 오면 크게 난동부려서\n큰 지진을 일으킨다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "把大沼澤當成自己的地盤。\n敵人一旦接近就會變得十分粗暴，\n並引起大地震。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il a besoin d’un marais entier pour vivre.\nSi un ennemi s’approche, il s’énerve et déclenche\nun séisme.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein Revier hat es im Sumpfland. Nähert sich\nein Feind, zappelt es wie wild und erzeugt so\nErdbeben.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Habita en grandes pantanos. Si se acerca un\nenemigo, monta en cólera y causa temblores\nmonumentales.",
